Offline feature teacher: google/siglip2-base-patch16-224
Source: https://huggingface.co/google/siglip2-base-patch16-224
Revision: 75de2d55ec2d0b4efc50b3e9ad70dba96a7b2fa2
Model-card license: Apache-2.0
Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.14786

Weights are downloaded separately, are not committed, and are not used in the
live stitched model. Only frozen vision-tower patch features are used as offline
supervision. The feature teacher is not a gameplay expert or an action oracle.

The reviewed static grounding/goal images include Open World Agents D2E-480p
(CC-BY-NC-4.0), as recorded in the dataset manifests and existing D2E notices.
Generated conditional-control targets are experimental probes, not demonstrated
human intentions. No checkpoint from these experiments is a qualified game agent.
